# AGENTS.md

## Quick Start

Welcome! Your project has an autonomous agent organization. Here's how to use it:

### Just type what you want
The agent will figure out which team to assign it to. No special syntax needed.

```
"Add a login page"           → frontend-team
"Fix the auth timeout bug"   → backend-team  
"Deploy to staging"          → infra-devops
"Review the open PRs"        → reviewer
```

### Key Commands
| Command | What it does |
|---------|-------------|
| `/head` | Activate orchestrator mode (delegates to teams) |
| `/pi` | Manage your pi setup (agents, skills, extensions) |
| `/help` | Show all commands |
| `/head status` | See what teams are working on |
| `/head triage` | Triage open issues |
| `/head deploy` | Run deployment pipeline |
| `/debug` | Start autonomous debug loop |
| `/cron` | Manage scheduled tasks |

